    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭōnas</span></b>  (or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Jōnas</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Vulg. Jon. 1, 1
