		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the Hebrew prophet
				Jonah</i>, <i><span class="en">Paul. Nol. Carm. 21,
			169</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sid. Carm. 16, 25</span></i>.
